window.products.push({"id":357018,"name":"Stonehouse Collection - Christmas Cards Boxed with Envelopes, Funny Christmas Cards, Happy Holidays Cards, Funny Santa Holiday Greeting Card, Bulk Chr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51dnCE20U-L._AC_.jpg","description":"UNIQUE CHRISTMAS CARDS: It's that time of year again! Greeting Cards are an easy way to spread the joy of the holidays and share the love with your friends, family members, and coworkers. Send them these holiday cards with envelopes and make someone's holiday season a little more special with these unique and witty Christmas cards that are sure to put a smile on their face. QUALITY YOU CAN TRUST: Give them a gift they can treasure for a long time. Our 5x7 folded Christmas greeting cards are made from quality material that won't get easily creased or folded. These holiday greeting cards have a glossy exterior finish, which makes the illustrations and graphics pop, while the non-glossy, matte interior of the card will allow you to write much more smoothly and easily without ink smudges. MEMORABLE AND FUNNY DESIGN: Add a little bit more laughter to your Christmas boxes this year. There are few things you can give that are better than a smile! Our greeting cards feature a unique and funny design that will make your friends, family and loved ones smile from ear to ear. Printed on quality cardstock, and with ample space to write a personalized message to make them feel special this holiday season. CHOOSE FROM A VARIETY OF DESIGNS: We are proud to offer an extensive catalog of Christmas greeting cards. Whether it's for business, friends or family, we have the personalized holiday card for you. You can also choose the best theme to fit your needs from our wide variety of options for this holiday season! ABOUT OUR BRAND: Stonehouse Collection is a family-owned and operated business that compiled all unique and funny Christmas cards, postcards, and humorous illustrations. Our family members have been making our products more than 40 years ago. They put them into a huge selection of funny postcards, stationery sets, Christmas cards, note cards, and more. We are committed to offering quality cards and stationery to brighten your day.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51dnCE20U-L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Stonehouse Collection","source_asin":"B07XH6Y7VX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-357018","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XH6Y7VX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XH6Y7VX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":357019,"name":"Grsolul Gaming Chair Office Chair High Back Computer Chair Ergonomic Video Game Chair Racing Leather Desk Chair Seat Height Adjustable Task Chair Swiv","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EEdgWI76S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Adjustable Game Chair】Grsolul ergonomic gaming chair covered by premium breathable leather and freely adjustable lumbar support & headrest pillow protecting your spinal & neck. No more back and neck pain or fatigue during long hours of gaming or work. You can find your comfort position by adjusting the seat height and reclining the backrest between 90° and 160°. And the soft armrest can be swiveled and raised, so your hands will be fighting at their best when working or playing computer games. 【Safety & Comfort Game Chair】Wider ergonomic backrest to fit the natural shape of the human back, 5-inch thick high-density shaped foam seat cushion - moderate hardness, rebound comfort, skin-friendly and wear-resistant, to provide you with the perfect seating experience. Class 4 cylinder, 2.2mm thick steel frame, 5-star base, all passed SGS BIFMA test, can withstand a stable weight of 300 pounds; Rubber casters that tested by 1000 miles rolling. 【Multi-Function & Easy to Assemble】Enjoyable rocking function; 90°~160° Reclining; Tilt locking mechanism; 360° swivel; Multi-direction smooth-rolling casters; 4D Armrest; Adjustable height of Armrest and Seat; Removable headrest pillow and lumbar pillow; Heavy duty 5-point base; We provide detailed and easy to understand installation instructions with the necessary installation tools. Everyone can quickly assemble a gaming chair. 【Wide Applications & Perfect Gift】You can enjoy it when you play computer game, watching tv, play station, mobile game and working in your home. This gaming chair is both for adults and teens. It is the perfect birthday, Valentine's Day, Thanksgiving or Christmas gift. It has a racing style and looks very stylish. Give it to your loved one, child or friend and be ready to receive their compliments. 【What We Offer】A brand new gaming chair, a complete set of installation tools, an installation instruction, a 30-day no-hassle refund or replacement, a 1-year warranty and our friendly after-sales service. Our customer service team is always here for you!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EEdgWI76S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Grsolul","source_asin":"B093PW2VZT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-357019","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093PW2VZT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093PW2VZT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":357020,"name":"Matador Leather Chindi Round Rug, Red, 8 by 8-Feet","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":149.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ZyTNWqFrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Durable as they are striking in design, the matador collection of leather rugs are meticulously made by hand-weaving leather strips as the weft of the rug and a fine cotton strand as the warp, resulting in a beautiful, rustic texture and interesting natural braided pattern. Add the smell and feel of real leather to any room with this red hand woven leather rug. Made of soft leather interwoven with a cotton foundation, this rugged rug makes sense ecologically, aesthetically and economically. Hand made in villages of north central India, this leather rug has shades of red throughout the rug. An elegant complement to any décor, this leather rug is completely reversible and extremely durable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ZyTNWqFrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Matador","source_asin":"B018NZZ9SG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-357020","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B018NZZ9SG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B018NZZ9SG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
