window.products.push({"id":357121,"name":"St. Patrick Day Decoration 3PC Set, Porch Sign Welcome Banner with Double Sided Irish Shamrock Yard Garden Flag for Indoor Outdoor Dark Green","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YcetTagZL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Oxford Fabric,Polyester Premium Quality. Rejolly porch sign and garden flag set are made from the high quality 100D polyester oxford fabric which is durable light weight and water resistant, bright vivid green color, sturdy enough to use rather long time. Package Includes: 2*porch sign & 1*double-sided garden flag. Available with 2 colors set, dark green and light green. Dark Green Set: green plaid porch sign printed with “LUCKY” and “St. Patricks Day”letters, garden flag printed shamrock hat and “Happy Happy St. Patricks”. Light Green Set: shamrock porch sign printed with “Happy” and “St. Patricks Day”letters, garden flag printed shamrock and “Happy Happy St. Patricks”. Considerable Design. The St. Patrick Day decoration banners come pre-assembled on a dowel with a sturdy ribbon, there are also 2 grommets on the bottom for you attach weights on to prevent them from blowing in the wind. The yard flag is designed in double sided with the shamrock image printed in vibrant color and visible from both sides, the text also reads correctly from both sides. Size. Porch Sign: 71*12 inches (180*30 cm), with large letters stenciled on it, can be read far away. Dress up your porch, welcome your guests and complete your St. Patrick's Day decorations with the pair of Irish signs. Yard Flag: 18*12 inches (45*30 cm), with about 1.5 inches opening, and fit all standard sized garden flag pole stand. Just slip in the flag through the openings on the top side onto the flag stand then it was ready to make your yard shine. (Item don't include the stand) Celebrate St. Patrick's Day with the beautiful porch sign and garden flag. Perfect for hanging on the front door, entryway, wall or above the fireplace mantel for a gorgeous holiday display. Dress up your home yard with the pleasant green color and impressive outdoor garden flags, they are amazing to boost atmosphere for holding St. Patrick and Saint Patrick's Day parade.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YcetTagZL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rejolly","source_asin":"B08R2L6VS6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-357121","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08R2L6VS6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08R2L6VS6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
