window.products.push({"id":357233,"name":"Jenaer Glas Wagenfeld Collection Tea Cup with Matching Saucer, Set of 2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6181dXSWXwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The historic brand Jenaer Glas stands for high quality household products made of heat resistant borosilicate glass. Developed from the Bauhaus-Tradition, Jenaer Glas combines convenient functionality of shapely tea sets, casserole dishes and serve ware in form and material, with a timeless distinguished design. The first oven-suitable household glassware was invented in Jena many years ago in the early 20th century. The acquisition by Zwiesel Kristal glass AG in 2006 today gives Jenaer Glas the newest options in materials and production-techniques. Today, as well as yesterday, Jenaer Glas is putting a spotlight on current food and drink trends and thanks to its suitability for daily use, this history-laden glassware brand has found its way into the repertoire of German kitchens. A masterpiece of Bauhaus design from the famed Wilhelm Wagenfeld, the Wilhelm Wagenfeld collection is a paradigm of design and is featured in many international design museums. Manufactured with the most modern technology, these cult pieces of dining culture can be enjoyed by anyone. Jenaer Glas features a set of 2 borosilicate glass tea cups and 2 porcelain saucers. Each cup holds 8.3 ounces and features a stylish handle to aid in your tea enjoyment.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6181dXSWXwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jenaer Glas","source_asin":"B00FLSA5GA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-357233","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00FLSA5GA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00FLSA5GA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
