window.products.push({"id":357322,"name":"Vellgoo Renewable Dehumidifier Over 300 Times+, Moisture Absorber Up to 333 Cubic Feet for Small Space Closet Car RV Boat SLR Camera Bag Shoe Cabinet ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61nZx77bERL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"RENEWABLE & NON-TOXIC: This renewable dehumidifier is spill and mess free and it may be reused over to 300 times+. Non-toxic since it is coated with silicone particles, safe for children and pets! Keep your small spaces will be dry and odorless, suitable for areas up to 333 cubic feet COMPACT & PORTABLE: This portable dehumidifier is compact yet powerful, which easily fits into small spaces. It is ideal to fight pesky humidity! Cars, rv, closets, boats, cabinets, gun safes, and even SLR camera bags UPGRADED SPLIT DESIGN & SMART CHIP: Compared with the traditional heating-integrated dehumidifier, the rechargeable gun safe dehumidifier automatically shuts off after 2 hours to prevent overheating, so that your safety is fully guaranteed (*Note Heating base must be purchased separately, Recommed to buy dehumidifier kit at first purchasing) 100% CORDLESS DEHUMIDIFIER: No cables or batteries are required when placed in the space to be dehumidified. When the beads turn dark green, simply place the dehumidifier body on its heating base to dry all of the beads and say goodbye to humidity! Lasts up to 4 weeks before needing to be recharged depending on the environmental humidity level EASY-VIEW INDICATOR WINDOW : A dual-color gradient (orange - green) creates a progressive transition, indicating a clear dehumidification state. Thirsty dry: light orange, drink up: dark green. The color-changing SiO₂ beads gradually turn dark green as they absorb moisture, letting you know when the unit is ready to recharge and reuse","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61nZx77bERL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vellgoo","source_asin":"B0B2DWDB14","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-357322","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B2DWDB14","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B2DWDB14","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
