window.products.push({"id":357340,"name":"ERNITERTY Cokunst Air Fryer 6.6 Quart 1500-Watt 8-in-1 AirFryer Toaster Oven, with One-Touch Programs, 8 Presets, Dishwasher Safe Nonstick Basket & Au","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716osRh3SKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[A Healthy Oilless Cooker]: up to 80% less oil and fat than traditionally deep fried food ; Cokunst air fryer has an upgraded technology of frying food by 360°hot air circulation, so it cooks evenly and locks in moisture to maintain their delicious taste. This is a perfect fryer in your kitchen. [A Versatile Oven]: this air fryer is with programmable temperature control from 100℉~392℉ to satisfy your different needs of frying different food; it can be used as oven, fryer, toaster, grill, dehydrator, microwave, sandwich maker, nonstick frying pan, popcorn maker and more. [Easy to Operate]: the LCD display is easy to read, simple one-touch controls is easy to use, the nonstick basket is dishwasher safe, easy to clean.The 8 cooking presets allow you to air-fry extra crispy chicken wings or delicious kebabs without any difficulty. [Large Capacity & Fast Cooking]: Cokunst airfryer has 6.6QT/7 liter large capacity, the non-stick basket of 5.2QT/5.5 liter capacity. It is designed for small parties & big family meals. With the 1500Watt high power, you can save almost 30% of time to finish cooking, compared to a conventional oven. [Build for Safety]: This product is with Stainless Steel exterior finish, the cool-touch handle prevent accidental detachment and touching of hot surfaces; Auto Shut Off when pulling out the basket and overheat Protection.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716osRh3SKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COKUNST","source_asin":"B08FB4K1PD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-357340","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FB4K1PD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FB4K1PD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
