window.products.push({"id":357390,"name":"FAAY 3-In-1 Wooden Spoons Handcrafted Golden Teak Kitchen Utensils Including 13.5 Inch Cooking Spoon, Slotted Spoon and 9 Inch Versatile Spoon, 100% N","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71d96ZcRKoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% CAREFREE COOKING EXPERIENCE (BUT CHEAPER!) Thinking of our valuable customers who love cooking, we decided to create the set of 3 teak spoons: Cooking, Slotted, and Versatile. Since each utensil serves different functions, we want to see you cook, serve, stir, mix, taste, and blend everything professionally while paying less. All of our spoons are durable, lightweight, and ergonomically designed with the local craftsmen and craftswomen to be conveniently used. 100% NATURAL Our FAAY Teak Cooking Spoon Set is from sustainable source of teaks in Thailand. Teaks are well known to be moist resistant. Here, they are golden brown, but since they are grown naturally, please be noted that the product color depends on types of soil (it can be either dark or light golden brown). Only Coconut oil finished, this is just to ensure our valuable customers’ good health and safety. 100% HANDMADE AND HEARTCRAFTED BY LOCAL ARTISANS Most of the wooden utensils nowadays are machinemade. Every piece of our products helps the local artisans maintain their remarkable craft skill and pass it down to the next generations. They are genuine artists, and they just need a little space to express their talent. Only you can provide them with that. Key Product Features 100% EASY TO TAKE CARE Wash them with warm water and soft sponge to preserve their qualities. We recommend you dry them by hanging. If there is something sticking to our spatulas, just put them in the water for 5 minutes before washing. Please store them in dry place when not used. When teak products are exposed to oil and heat, their color normally becomes darker, but they are still perfectly useable. 100% WARRANTY GUARANTEED In case our spoons do not come in their best condition like in the photo or get broken after being used for 30 days, just let us know. We sincerely apologize and will definitely send you the new ones in no time. We appreciate all your remarks and comments. They are the key tools to develop and improve our handmade and heartcrafted products.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71d96ZcRKoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FAAY","source_asin":"B07569B1ZT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-357390","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07569B1ZT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07569B1ZT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
