window.products.push({"id":357473,"name":"Slushy Maker Cup, TIK TOK Magic Quick Frozen Smoothies Cup, Portable Double Layer Slushy Maker Cup, Slushie Machine with Straw and Spoon, Ice Cream Ma","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RObpAO5cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Quick Frozen Magic Slushy Cup】No complicated steps and machines, this slushy cup has built-in freezing liquid, transforming any liquid drink into refreshing slush in just a few seconds. Freeze the slushy maker cup for 4-6 hours, then pour in whatever you want. Squeeze it for a while, you will get a delicious, safe, and hygienic smoothie quickly,without diluting the original flavor. 【100% Food Grade Safe Material】This slushie maker cup is made of BPA Free, food-grade silicone, which is durable and healthy. This frozen magic slushy maker is 100% safe for kids. The slushy cup body adapts food-grade silicone, soft and non-deformable.The ice cream machine all parts are adapted detachable design for easy cleaning. You can wash cups with water and refreeze them for repeated use. 【DIY Fun Smoothie Cup】Your child can make their smoothies, and have fun making slushes by combining different drinks. It's perfect for juice or soda, or add milk to make a fruit shake. You can put summer fruits and oats on it. Everyone can customize their smoothies at home and enjoy the fun. 【2 in 1 Straw and Spoon】Detachable straw and spoon design, it can be used as a spoon or as a straw separately, meet your different needs. Whether smoothie or ice cream, you can easily use it for different drinks. Enjoy different flavors of sand ice parties. 【 Creative Gift 】Our portable smoothie cups you can use at home, in the office, in the car, on the beach, on the go. It is a great creative gift for family, friends, colleagues, classmates and children. With just simple steps, everyone can easily make delicious smoothies anywhere.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RObpAO5cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KGKTU","source_asin":"B0B3XFRY1S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-357473","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B3XFRY1S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B3XFRY1S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
