window.products.push({"id":357639,"name":"Milk Frother,4 IN 1 Detachable Electric Milk Steamer Stainless Steel,10.1oz/300ml Automatic Hot/Cold Foam Maker & Milk Warmer with 4 Modes for Latte/C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Od9XXwFBS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"☕4-in-1 MULTI FUNCTION - One button offers 4 settings which allow you effortlessly to make different drinks such as cappuccino, latte, mocha, and flat white, etc. The Cappuccino function will give you a thick and creamy froth and the Latte function will give you a smooth and silky froth. The Iced Cappuccino function is great for iced coffee flavors. Whole milk (using>2%) is recommended for the best results. The Warm Milk function could heat milk for your baby and the temperature is perfect. ☕DISHWASHER SAFE - The removable milk jug is extremely convenient to be cleaned by a dishwasher or by hand. Just give the jug a quick rinse and the stains can be completely removed just in a few seconds. The frothing disk easily pops out and clean-up is super-simple. The surface of the frother base can be wiped with a soft damp cloth. ☕LARGE CAPACITY - This JASSY milk frother offers large capacity. The maximum capacity of latte function is 9.8oz/290ml and the maximum capacity of cappuccino function is 5.1oz/150ml. Large froth capacity shares multiple cups of fancy coffee at a time for the household. And the compact design of JASSY milk frother saves your counter space. ☕SAFE & DURABLE - Made of premium food-grade 304 stainless steel, no non-stick coating which makes it healthier. The innovative convection heating technology makes this electronic milk frother last longer by heating up the milk evenly and stopping immediately when overheating is detected. Flame retardant operation base, auto-off function, safety assurance. ☕IMPORTANT NOTE - It is essential to refer the instruction manual carefully before using the device for the first time. And ensure power is off when not in use to double the lifetime of your frother. Contact us via Amazon email if you have any questions or need assistance. We will respond to you within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Od9XXwFBS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JASSY","source_asin":"B0BKZCXGDV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-357639","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BKZCXGDV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BKZCXGDV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
