window.products.push({"id":357663,"name":"Stainless Steel Chilling Stones Reusable Skull Head Ice Cubes Set of 4 - Whiskey Wine Beer Vodka Chillers (silver)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51dwlrdZNAL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"A set of four Stainless Steel Skull Head Cubes are the perfect choice for people who do not like to compromise on the quality of their drinks while chilling them. The cubes are suitable for chilling all kinds of alcohols like whiskey, wine, vodka and other spirits. Unlike water, the stainless steel skull head cubes neither dilute the drinks nor affect their flavor. This characteristic of the cubes makes them a must-have for people who share a refined and distinguished taste for alcohol. These chillers provide a quick chill to drinks, sparing the need to wait for the refrigerator to cool them; Description The cubes are 38x23x27 mm in size and weigh 1.3 ounces each. The set includes a set of 4 stainless steel skull head cubes 4 Silver Skulls and a velvet pouch to hold them together. The skull heads have liquid interior which makes them light enough to not damage the glass and heavy enough to sink to the bottom. The flat bottom of the cubes make it easy to sit them face up. The attractive velvet pouch renders the entire package beautiful, makes it easy to carry around and turns it into a perfect gift item. Tips Freeze the cubes for at least 2 hours before using them for drinks. After placing them in drinks, wait for a few minutes to let the cubes chill the drink. The cubes are quite big and therefore a single cube in a drink should do the job for most people. It is recommended to wash the steel cubes before first use and also after every use. A quick rinse will turn the cubes as good as new. To prevent the risk of accidentally choking on the cubes or the cubes hitting the teeth, it is strictly advised to remove the cubes before consuming the alcohol.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51dwlrdZNAL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aracoware","source_asin":"B07TD6D3P7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-357663","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TD6D3P7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TD6D3P7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
