window.products.push({"id":357714,"name":"Fabric Gift Bags for Christmas Presents, Set of 6 Christmas Drawstring Gift Bags, Cloth Gift Bags, Christmas Gift Bags, Christmas Drawstring Bag, Reus","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91rIatbZSSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FABRIC CHRISTMAS BAGS set includes six generously sized cloth gift bags with drawstring closures, expandable bottoms for bulky presents, plus 6 holiday gift tags. Your Christmas gift bags are an ideal size to wrap small to large sized Christmas gifts. The smallest bag comfortably FITS 1 SODA CAN AND THE LARGEST FITS 25 SODA CANS PREMIUM QUALITY CLOTH GIFT BAG - Forget about the usual paper gift bags or boxes that get smashed before you even give them out! These beautifully designed Christmas gifts bags are made of the highest quality non-woven fabric. They are extremely durable and ARE 100% REUSABLE. The vibrant white design is printed on the front and back of each Christmas gift bag. COLORS ARE LONG-LASTING, WILL NOT FADE NO TISSUE PAPER NEEDED - Perfect for all those hard-to-wrap gifts, these Christmas fabric gift bags take the stress out of wrapping presents. Simply place your presents in the drawstring fabric gift bags, cinch the satin ribbon drawstrings, and tie on the matching holiday-themed gift tag. The Christmas fabric gift bag is perfect for people who love to give gifts but don't like to wrap presents or fuss with tissue paper. These Christmas gift wrap bags MAKE WRAPPING EASY STUNNING PRESENTATION EVERY TIME - Allow these reusable fabric gift bags to make every gift you give more memorable. If you’re looking for bulk holiday fabric gift bags for kids, seniors or adults for Christmas presents for mom, dad, or grandma; our Christmas drawstrings gift bags are a perfect fit. The fabric bags are great for gifts like chocolates, candies, and other goodies. Don’t settle for a boring paper bag this season, upgrade your present wrapping game with our stunning Santa sack HIGHEST QUALITY CONTROL - We know you care about quality, so do we. Our partner factory has focused on non-woven fabric bags for more than 15 years. Our team believes in Customer First, Quality Foremost. These reusable Christmas gift bags have been designed, packaged and quality inspected in the USA. You can trust that your orders will be produced with pride and are of the highest standards.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91rIatbZSSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mistorri","source_asin":"B0BSR9QKB1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-357714","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BSR9QKB1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BSR9QKB1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":357715,"name":"Freshware 12-Pack Silicone Mini Round Reusable Cupcake and Muffin Baking Cup, Black and Red Colors","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cko6JpicL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Create your own special desserts or homemade soaps with the Freshware CB-304RB 12-Pack Silicone Mini Round Reusable Cupcake and Muffin Baking Cup, Black and Red Colors. This baking cup is constructed with 100% pure, professional quality food-grade silicone, which meets US FDA and European LFGB safety standards (BPA, PVC and Phthalate FREE). Simply pour your favorite recipe in the cup, prepare, and cool completely. Then turn it upside down, this flexible silicone cup offers a non-stick surface that allows the baked goods to pop right out with a little push from the bottom. Remember to place the silicone baking cups on a baking sheet for easier positioning and removal. Cup Size: 2.8 inch top x 2 inch bottom diameter x 1 inch depth. Volume: 12 x 2.2 oz, Total 26.4 oz. Includes 12-cup. Many customers have found creative ways to use Freshware silicone baking cups (depending upon the shape) to create delicious homemade cupcakes, muffins, brownies, cheesecakes, bento boxes, chocolate and snack bowls, frozen baby foods, gelatin, ice creams etc. Other customers use the molds in unique ways to create clays, resin casting, candles, soaps and more. All Freshware silicone products DO NOT have Chemical Coatings and are Pinch Test Passed. Our silicone mold handles temperature from -40 to +446 degrees Fahrenheit (-40 to +230 degrees Celsius). Reusable for up to 3,000 uses, our molds save money by eliminating the need to ever buy disposable paper liners again. Safe to use in the Oven, Refrigerator, Freezer, Microwave, Steamer and Dishwasher. Top rack dishwasher safe, but hand washing is recommended to extend the life of the product. What Is A Pinch Test? Cheaper brands often use plastic fillers in their silicone products, so it is not safe for high-temperature baking. Pinch and twist a bit of the silicone, if it turns white, it’s got fillers as 100% pure silicone will retain its color.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cko6JpicL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Freshware","source_asin":"B009ANAFLW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-357715","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B009ANAFLW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B009ANAFLW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
