window.products.push({"id":357822,"name":"TOFOVER Diamond Paintings Kit, Part Drill 5D Diamond Painting for Kids Adult Handcraft Kit Crystal Rhinestone Embroidery Cross Stitch with Tools(Framl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613sy8kz+bL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Specifications: Frame: no Material: canvas + resin rhinestone Size：30X30 AND 30X40CM Tools:canvas / drill pen / self closed OPP bag / plastic tray / solid glue / multi-color diamonds Instructions for the assembly of the 5D diamond painting embroidery kit : Open the package, check the diamond-specific tools, seven kinds. Colour code is printed directly on the mat you are working on, I am afraid that you may need to stick them according to the turns, avoiding being in mess. Place a bag of beads in the plastic tray, in general, the number is more than 30% it should need, we still hope that you can cherish the crystals since acquaintance is fate. Pull back the plastic covering to expose the picture, keep the cover, because you can not finish the painting at one time,I spend a week leisure time to completed mine, as you know, kids, work.anyway, it is a real relaxing moment for me. The canvas is coated with a sticky adhesive. putting some solid glue on the tip of the pen. Pick up a bead then releases the diamond(flat part of it) to the corresponding number on the canvas Even after placing the diamond in the photo, you can easily move it with the pen if it isn't exactly where it needs to go. when you finished, just place books on top to embed the diamonds into the print well In the end, you can enjoy the moment, if you have any problem, welcome to contact me, I am a fan of this kind of \"work\" , so I can solve for you Package included： One Piece of Diamond Painting (with rhinestone need to paste) + one set Crystal Paste Tool Kit","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613sy8kz+bL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TOFOVER","source_asin":"B07P7SPHBM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-357822","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07P7SPHBM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07P7SPHBM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
